Sidecar Architecture
Deploys lightweight network proxies (e.g., Envoy) alongside every service instance to capture, analyze, and manage all incoming and outgoing network traffic.

Service Discovery: Automatically updates routing tables as container scheduler nodes spawn or terminate.
Circuit Breakers: Monitors call failure rates and open-circuits failing upstream services to prevent cascading system failures.
Retry Policies with Exponential Backoff: Retries failed requests with randomized delay jitter to prevent overwhelming recovering services.
Mutual TLS (mTLS): Encrypts and authenticates all internal service-to-service communication.
